    <!-- ===== Welcome tutorial ===== -->
    <string name="tutorial_intro">Welcome to Vidente. We\'ll practise the gestures one by one. You can repeat this tutorial any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_explore">First gesture: explore. Rest one finger on the screen and move it slowly. Vidente will read out whatever is under your finger, without activating anything. Try it now: touch anywhere on the screen.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_explore_ok">Well done. That\'s exploring.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_double_tap">Second gesture: activate. Double tap quickly anywhere on the screen. You don\'t have to tap right on the item: it activates the last one Vidente read. Try it now: two quick taps.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_double_tap_ok">Well done. That\'s activating.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_navigate">Third gesture: moving around the screen, item by item. Swipe one finger right to go to the next item, and left to go back to the previous one. Vidente reads each item as you reach it. Let\'s try both.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_navigate_first">Start by swiping right to go to the next item.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_system">Fourth and last gesture: the system bar. Swipe up to go Home. Swipe down then left, in one movement, for Back. And down then right for Recents. Let\'s try all three.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_system_first">Start by swiping up for Home.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading">Fifth gesture: continuous reading. Swipe down and back up without lifting your finger, and Vidente will start reading from where you are to the end. A tap on the screen pauses it; the same down-and-up gesture resumes it. And swiping up and back down repeats the last phrase. Let\'s try those two.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading_first">Start by swiping down and back up without lifting your finger.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_modes">Sixth and last gesture: changing mode. Swiping straight down cycles through the modes: element, character, word, line, paragraph, headings, links, controls and fields. Vidente says the mode as it changes. Then swiping right or left moves you according to the chosen mode.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_modes_first">Try it now: swipe straight down.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_done">The tutorial is finished. You can repeat it any time from Settings, with the Repeat tutorial button.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_nav_ok_next">Good, next item.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_nav_ok_prev">Good, previous item.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_nav_next_right">Now swipe right to go to the next item.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_nav_next_left">Now swipe left to go back to the previous one.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_ok_home">Good, that\'s Home.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_ok_back">Good, that\'s Back.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_ok_recents">Good, that\'s Recents.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_next_home">Now swipe up for Home.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_next_back">Now swipe down then left for Back.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_sys_next_recents">Now swipe down then right for Recents.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading_ok_start">Good, that\'s how you start continuous reading.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading_ok_repeat">Good, that\'s how you repeat the last phrase.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading_next_start">Now swipe down and back up without lifting your finger, to start continuous reading.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_reading_next_repeat">Now swipe up and back down without lifting your finger, to repeat the last phrase.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_modes_ok">Good, that\'s how you change mode.</string>

